{"video_id": "6tiTNPOslzc", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 10.119999885559082, "end_seconds": 12.720000267028809, "text": "Unos cuentan chistes, otros se disfrazan,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
